      "pos": [
        55,
        0
      ],
      "data": {
        "text": "This patch is slow on purpose. Leave it running and come back in ten minutes.\nScan Processor draws the picture as bright lines that are pushed up by how bright it is underneath.\nThe picture underneath is a video oscillator mixed with a soft grey shape.\nSix very slow LFOs, with cycles between 40 seconds and 3 minutes, bend the lines, the stripes, the shape and the colour at unrelated paces, so the same view rarely comes back.\nTry LUMA GAIN, INTENSITY and PERSIST on the Scan Processor, or turn up the depth on the Dual LFO Chaos."
      }
    }
  ],
